<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#11130f" />
    <meta name="description" content="Build a robot factory. Automate, upgrade, and explore." />
    <title>Scrapbound — Robot Automation</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <a class="brand" href="#factory"><span class="brand-icon">S</span><span>SCRAPBOUND<small>ROBOT AUTOMATION</small></span></a>
        <div class="side-label">WORKSHOP</div>
        <nav class="nav-list">
          <a class="nav-link active" href="/factory" data-route="/factory" aria-current="page"><span>▦</span> Factory <kbd>1</kbd></a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/brains" data-route="/brains"><span>⌘</span> Brain lab <kbd>2</kbd></a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/technology" data-route="/technology"><span>⬡</span> Tech tree <kbd>3</kbd></a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/expeditions" data-route="/expeditions"><span>↗</span> Expeditions <kbd>4</kbd></a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/community" data-route="/community"><span>◎</span> Community <kbd>5</kbd></a>
          <a class="nav-link hidden" id="admin-catalog-nav" href="/admin/catalog" data-route="/admin/catalog"><span>⚙</span> Catalog studio</a>
          <a class="nav-link hidden" id="admin-technology-nav" href="/admin/technology" data-route="/admin/technology"><span>⬡</span> Tech editor</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="online-dot"></div><span>LOCAL SIMULATION</span><small>SYNC: BROWSER SAVE</small></div>
      </aside>
      <main class="main-area">
        <header class="topbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">FRONTIER SECTOR 07 <span>•</span> CYCLE <b id="cycle-label">01</b></div><h1 id="page-title">Factory floor</h1></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="save-state"><i></i> <span id="save-label">Saved locally</span></span><button class="button button-account" id="auth-button">Sign in</button><button class="icon-button" id="settings-button" title="Settings">⚙</button></div></header>
        <section class="resource-strip" aria-label="Resources">
          <div class="resource"><span class="resource-symbol coin">¢</span><div><small class="server-value hidden" id="credits-server">SERVER ¢0</small><small>LOCAL CREDITS</small><strong id="credits">0</strong></div><em id="credits-rate">JOB DELIVERIES</em></div>
          <div class="resource"><span class="resource-symbol scrap">▧</span><div><small class="server-value hidden" id="scrap-server">SERVER ▧0</small><small>LOCAL SCRAP</small><strong id="scrap">0</strong></div><em id="scrap-rate">JOB DELIVERIES</em></div>
          <div class="resource"><span class="resource-symbol shard">✳</span><div><small>CORE SHARDS</small><strong id="shards">0</strong></div><em>PRESTIGE</em></div>
          <div class="resource rank-resource"><span class="resource-symbol rank">⌁</span><div><small>FACTORY RANK</small><strong id="rank">Rookie</strong></div><em id="robots-owned">0 robots</em></div>
        </section>
        <section class="view active" id="view-factory">
          <section class="panel contract-panel" aria-label="Factory contract"><div id="factory-contract"></div></section>
          <div class="factory-layout">
            <article class="panel scene-panel" id="scene-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LIVE WORKSHOP</div><h2>Assembly bay <span class="live-tag"><i></i> LIVE</span></h2><small class="camera-hint">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom</small></div><div class="scene-controls"><select id="camera-follow" aria-label="Follow robot"><option value="">Free camera</option></select><label class="accessibility-setting">Quality <select id="render-quality" aria-label="Render quality"><option value="low">Low</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="high">High</option></select></label><label class="accessibility-setting"><input id="reduced-motion" type="checkbox"> Reduced motion</label><button class="button button-secondary" id="simulation-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Ⅱ Pause</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="simulation-speed">1× Speed</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="scene-fullscreen">⛶ Full screen</button><button class="icon-button" id="camera-button" title="Reset camera">⌖</button></div></div><div id="factory-scene" class="scene"></div><aside class="scene-hud" id="scene-hud"><div class="scene-hud-resources"><span>¢ <b id="scene-credits">0</b></span><span>▧ <b id="scene-scrap">0</b></span></div><div id="scene-crew-status">Your robot activity will appear here.</div></aside><aside class="scene-quickshop" id="fullscreen-shop" aria-label="Quick purchases"></aside><div class="scene-footer"><span><i class="legend-dot green"></i> ACTIVE UNITS <b id="scene-active">0</b></span><span><i class="legend-dot amber"></i> SIMULATION <b id="scene-rate">Waiting</b></span><span id="camera-mode">FREE CAMERA</span></div></article>
            <article class="panel production-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">AUTOMATION</div><h2>Robot crew</h2></div><span class="count-pill" id="unit-count">0 / 20</span></div><div id="production-list" class="production-list"></div><div id="crew-status" class="crew-status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="delivery-feed" id="delivery-feed" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="panel-note">Robots only earn by following their program, collecting a visible salvage cache, and returning cargo to the bay. Change their behavior in Brain lab.</div></article>
          </div>
            <div class="lower-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</div><h2>Workshop upgrades</h2></div><span class="subtle">PERMANENT THIS CYCLE</span></div><div class="upgrade-grid" id="upgrade-list"></div></article><article class="panel prestige-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESET. REBUILD. ASCEND.</div><h2>Core synthesis</h2></div><span class="prestige-glyph">✳</span></div><p>Convert this cycle's production into Core Shards. Your factory resets, but each shard permanently boosts output.</p><div class="prestige-summary"><span>ESTIMATED SHARDS</span><strong>✳ <b id="prestige-preview">0</b></strong></div><button id="prestige-button" class="button button-prestige">Begin synthesis <span>→</span></button></article></div>
            <article class="panel technology-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LONG-TERM RESEARCH</div><h2>Technology tree</h2></div><span class="subtle">UNLOCK · EXPAND · MULTIPLY</span></div><div id="technology-tree" class="technology-tree"><div class="panel-note">Sign in to research persistent technology.</div></div></article>
           <article class="panel buddy-style-panel"><div id="buddy-style-shop"></div></article>
          <article class="panel inventory-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SERVER-OWNED ITEMS</div><h2>Item inventory</h2></div><button class="button button-secondary" id="inventory-refresh">Refresh inventory</button></div><div id="inventory-items" class="battle-list"><div class="panel-note">Sign in to view items earned from missions.</div></div><div id="inventory-receipts" class="panel-note"></div><div class="eyebrow battle-history-heading">ESCROW ITEM TRADE</div><div class="battle-controls"><label>Trade partner<select id="trade-recipient"></select></label><label>Item<select id="trade-item"></select></label><label>Quantity<input id="trade-quantity" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label><label>Credits requested<input id="trade-price" type="number" min="1" value="25"></label><button class="button button-primary" id="trade-create">Create escrow offer</button></div><div id="trade-status" class="panel-note">Creating an offer reserves items. Settlement transfers items and credits atomically; offers expire after 48 hours.</div><div id="trade-list" class="battle-list"></div></article>
         </section>
        <section class="view" id="view-brains"><div class="brain-intro panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">ROBOT PROGRAMMING</div><h2>Give your machines a brain.</h2><p>Build a routine, choose what to collect, then deploy it. Only the actions in the running program affect robot behavior.</p></div><div class="brain-template" id="brain-template"><span>⌘</span><div><b>Salvage scout</b><small>Patrol → scan → collect</small></div><button id="load-template" class="button button-secondary">Load template</button></div></div><div class="blockly-panel panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">VISUAL PROGRAM</div><h2 id="brain-name">Salvage routine</h2></div><div class="brain-actions"><input id="brain-name-input" value="Salvage routine" aria-label="Program name"><select id="brain-deploy-target" aria-label="Assign program to"><option value="all">Entire crew</option></select><button class="button button-secondary" id="save-brain">Save</button><button class="button button-primary" id="deploy-brain">Deploy</button></div></div><div id="blockly-workspace"></div><div class="panel-note" id="brain-status">Robot actions execute in the factory simulation. Returning to base is automatic; resources are awarded only on delivery.</div></div><article class="panel control-lab"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PILOT CONFIGURATIONS</div><h2>Customize each bot</h2></div><span class="subtle">SAVED IN THIS BROWSER</span></div><div class="control-config-row"><label>Robot<select id="control-target"><option value="0">Unit 01</option></select></label><label>Configuration<select id="control-profile"><option value="Default">Default</option></select></label><button class="button button-secondary" id="control-new-profile">＋ New config</button><button class="button button-primary" id="control-assign-profile">Switch bot config</button></div><div class="control-config-row"><label>Driving mode<select id="control-mode"><option value="program">Run Blockly program</option><option value="keyboard">Keyboard pilot</option><option value="mouse">Mouse pilot</option></select></label><div class="keybinds" id="keybinds"><span>Move</span><button data-bind="up">↑ W</button><button data-bind="left">← A</button><button data-bind="down">↓ S</button><button data-bind="right">→ D</button></div><span id="control-status" class="control-status">Select a bot and configuration to customize.</span></div><div class="panel-note">Keyboard pilot: hold the configured keys to steer. Mouse pilot: click a point in the workshop to send the selected bot there. Releasing manual control resumes its assigned Blockly program.</div><div class="server-template-list" id="server-template-list"><div class="panel-note">Sign in to sync robot jobs and brain templates.</div></div></article></section>
         <section class="view" id="view-expeditions"><div class="expedition-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">AUTONOMOUS OPERATIONS</div><h2>Salvage expeditions</h2><p>Send your crew out for scrap. Join a co-op contract to contribute mission completions with other pilots.</p></div><div class="sector-pill">CURRENT SECTOR <b id="sector-number">01</b></div></div><section class="panel cooperative-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PILOTS WORKING TOGETHER</div><h2>Co-op salvage jobs</h2></div><button class="button button-secondary" id="cooperative-refresh">Refresh jobs</button></div><div class="battle-controls"><label>Sector<select id="cooperative-sector"><option value="1">Sector 01</option></select></label><label>Contributions needed<select id="cooperative-goal"><option value="2">2 pilots</option><option value="3" selected>3 pilots</option><option value="4">4 pilots</option></select></label><button class="button button-primary" id="cooperative-create">Create job</button></div><div id="cooperative-notice" class="panel-note">Complete a server-timed mission to contribute. Contributors split no inventory; each receives a fixed server-wallet reward when the job completes.</div><div id="cooperative-jobs" class="battle-list"></div><div class="eyebrow battle-history-heading">YOUR NOTIFICATIONS</div><div id="cooperative-notifications" class="battle-list"></div></section><div id="mission-list" class="mission-list"></div><article class="panel expedition-result hidden" id="mission-result"></article><section id="battle-arena" class="panel battle-arena"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">ASYNC ROBOT ARENA</div><h2>Defense snapshots</h2></div><button class="button button-secondary" id="battle-refresh">Refresh arena</button></div><div class="battle-controls"><label>Defense robot<select id="battle-unit"></select></label><button class="button button-primary" id="battle-publish">Publish defense snapshot</button><span id="battle-status" class="panel-note">Challenges resolve from server-owned robot/program snapshots.</span></div><div id="battle-defenses" class="battle-list"></div><div class="eyebrow battle-history-heading">NPC ARENA · USE YOUR PVP BUILD</div><div class="battle-controls"><label>NPC encounter<select id="pve-encounter"></select></label><button class="button button-primary" id="pve-fight">Fight NPC</button><span id="pve-status" class="panel-note">Select a saved robot build and challenge a server-controlled opponent.</span></div><div id="pve-history" class="battle-list"></div><div class="eyebrow battle-history-heading">ACTIVE SEASON LEAGUE</div><div id="battle-progression" class="battle-list"></div><div class="eyebrow battle-history-heading">RECENT MATCH HISTORY</div><div id="battle-history" class="battle-list"></div></section></section>
        <section class="view" id="view-community">
          <div class="expedition-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">PLAYERS HELP PLAYERS</div><h2>Community board</h2><p>Ask for a hand, find a trade, or team up on a project.</p></div><div class="community-online"><i></i> COMMUNITY</div></div>
          <div id="community-readonly" class="panel community-notice">The community board is loading…</div>
          <form id="community-compose" class="panel compose-panel hidden">
            <div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">POST TO THE BOARD</div><h2>Start something together</h2></div><select id="post-kind" aria-label="Post type"><option value="help">🛠 Ask for help</option><option value="trade">⇄ Trade offer</option><option value="collab">🤝 Collaboration</option></select></div>
            <div class="compose-fields"><input id="post-title" maxlength="90" placeholder="Give your post a clear title" required><textarea id="post-body" maxlength="600" rows="3" placeholder="What do you need, or what are you planning? Be kind and specific…" required></textarea><div id="trade-fields" class="trade-fields hidden"><input id="trade-offering" maxlength="120" placeholder="I can offer…"><input id="trade-seeking" maxlength="120" placeholder="I'm looking for…"></div><div class="compose-footer"><span id="compose-message" class="form-message"></span><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Post to community <span>→</span></button></div></div>
          </form>
          <div class="community-toolbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">OPEN TRANSMISSIONS</div><h2>Find your people</h2></div><button id="community-refresh" class="button button-secondary">↻ Refresh</button></div>
          <div id="community-feed" class="community-feed"><div class="panel community-notice">Connect to the server to load community posts.</div></div>
        </section>
        <section class="view" id="view-admin-catalog">
          <div class="expedition-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</div><h2>Catalog studio</h2><p>Edit game content through structured forms, validate a preview, then create an immutable version.</p></div><div class="community-online">ADMIN ONLY</div></div>
          <article class="panel catalog-editor"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">STRUCTURED CONTENT</div><h2>Catalog editor</h2></div><div class="catalog-editor-actions"><button class="button button-secondary" id="catalog-preview">Validate preview</button><button class="button button-primary" id="catalog-create-draft">Create immutable draft</button></div></div><div id="catalog-structured-editor" class="structured-catalog-editor"></div><details class="catalog-advanced"><summary>Advanced JSON editor</summary><textarea id="catalog-content" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Advanced catalog JSON"></textarea><button class="button button-secondary" id="catalog-apply-json">Apply JSON to structured editor</button></details><div id="catalog-message" class="panel-note">Only administrators can access catalog editing.</div><pre id="catalog-preview-output" class="hidden"></pre></article>
          <section class="panel catalog-versions"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">VERSION HISTORY</div><h2>Catalog versions</h2></div><button class="button button-secondary" id="catalog-refresh">Refresh</button></div><div id="catalog-version-list"></div></section>
        </section>
        <section class="view" id="view-admin-technology">
          <div class="expedition-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION · RESEARCH SYSTEMS</div><h2>Technology graph editor</h2><p>Add nodes, connect prerequisites, and configure allowlisted gameplay unlocks. Preview and publish through the same immutable catalog workflow.</p></div><div class="community-online">ADMIN ONLY</div></div>
          <article class="panel admin-tech-graph-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BRANCH PREVIEW</div><h2>Unlock structure</h2></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="/admin/catalog" data-route="/admin/catalog">All catalog sections →</a></div><div id="admin-tech-graph" class="admin-tech-graph"></div></article>
          <article class="panel catalog-editor admin-tech-editor"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">NODE DEFINITIONS</div><h2>Technology nodes</h2></div><div class="catalog-editor-actions"><button class="button button-secondary" id="technology-add-node">＋ Add node</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="technology-preview">Validate tree</button><button class="button button-primary" id="technology-create-draft">Create immutable draft</button></div></div><div id="technology-structured-editor" class="structured-catalog-editor"></div><div id="technology-message" class="panel-note">Only administrators can edit technology.</div><pre id="technology-preview-output" class="hidden"></pre></article>
        </section>
        <section class="view" id="view-not-found"><article class="panel not-found"><div class="eyebrow">404 · SIGNAL LOST</div><h2>This sector isn't mapped.</h2><p>That route doesn't lead anywhere. Head back to a known part of the workshop.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/factory" data-route="/factory">Return to factory <span>→</span></a></article></section>
        <section class="view" id="view-technology"><div class="expedition-header technology-view-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</div><h2>Technology tree</h2><p>Choose a branch, unlock new field capabilities, and grow your operation.</p></div><div class="community-online">PERSISTENT RESEARCH</div></div><div id="technology-view-host"></div></section>
        <footer class="footer"><span>SCRAPBOUND <b>PROTOTYPE 0.1</b></span><span>Built for the long haul <span class="footer-star">✳</span></span></footer>
      </main>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-overlay hidden" id="auth-overlay" role="presentation">
      <section class="auth-dialog panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="auth-title">
        <button class="icon-button auth-close" id="auth-close" aria-label="Close sign in">×</button>
        <div class="eyebrow">FRONTIER ACCOUNT</div><h2 id="auth-title">Join the crew.</h2><p>Save a name for your pilot and meet other builders.</p>
        <form id="auth-form"><label>Callsign<input id="auth-username" autocomplete="username" minlength="3" maxlength="20" required placeholder="3–20 letters, numbers, _"></label><label>Password<input id="auth-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="8" maxlength="72" required placeholder="At least 8 characters"></label><div id="auth-message" class="form-message" role="status"></div><button class="button button-primary auth-submit" id="auth-submit" type="submit">Sign in <span>→</span></button></form>
        <button class="auth-switch" id="auth-mode">New here? Create an account</button>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    @vite('resources/js/main.js')
  </body>
</html>
